## Legal and ethical

trsp:typeLegalEthicsChecks
  skos:definition "A category within improvement and enhancement activity identifying legal and ethical verification for research repositories and services."@en ; # definition added automatically
    a skos:Concept ;
  skos:prefLabel "Legal and Ethical Verification"@en ;
